  "title": "Instagram Adds 15-Minute Edit Window for Stories",
  "summary": "Instagram allows users to edit their Stories for up to 15 minutes after sharing them, enabling text, music, stickers, and drawings without deleting the content. Adam Mosseri announced the feature, which was initially reported by Engadget.",
