      "description": "Instagram's latest update will allow you to edit your Stories without losing your views, likes, or replies. You can now edit the text, music, stickers, and drawings for up to 15 minutes after sharing your Story, Instagram head Adam Mosseri has announced. Reverse engineer Alessandro Paluzzi first spotted Instagram working on this feature in April, [&#8230;]",
